{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51671","headline":"再游圣母阁（《舆地纪胜》十《绍兴府》诗摘第二联题《游天衣寺》） · 钱弘倧","name":"再游圣母阁（《舆地纪胜》十《绍兴府》诗摘第二联题《游天衣寺》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越地灵踪多少处，伽蓝难上此楼台。\n有时风掣浪声到，半夜月排山势来。\n极目烟岚迷远近，百般花木雕尘埃。\n可怜光景吟无尽，知我登临更几回。\n（以上《吴越钱氏传芳集》）（〖1〗《会稽掇英总集》卷八收此诗，署「钱倧」，题作《再游应天寺圣母阁》。\n第二句「难上」作「难尚」，第四句「山势」作「山影」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱弘倧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}